-PROCEDURE UpdateUniverse;
+{ PATCH (fpc): UpdateUniverse deleted -- whole-galaxy tick loop plus
+  screen progress window (ClrScr/OpenWindow/WriteString/CloseWindow, the only
+  Crt/EIO/WND usage in this unit); this harness calls UpdateWorld directly
