+{ PATCH (fpc): LoadScenario's parsing helpers and SF-token-parsing command handlers (Phase 2 commit
+  2e), relocated verbatim from NEWGAME.PAS -- see the INTERFACE-section comment above these
+  forward-declarations for the full list of what's relocated and the two documented exceptions
+  (CreateNPEmpire's dropped InitializeNPE call, CreateRandomWorlds' dropped GotoXY call).
+
+  The var-string-checking directive right below relaxes a compile-time-only check: AllUpCase(VAR
+  Strg: MaxStr) (STRG.PAS, MaxStr=STRING[255]) is called here with LineStr/String8
+  (STRING[80]/STRING[8]) variables -- fpc's default strict mode requires a VAR parameter's declared
+  type to match exactly, which none of this relocated code was ever compiled against before (nothing
+  already in this harness called AllUpCase). Not a behavior change: a short-string VAR parameter is
+  passed by reference over the same length-prefixed byte buffer regardless of its declared max
+  length, and AllUpCase only uppercases existing bytes in place, never grows the string, so aliasing
+  a smaller actual buffer through the larger formal type is memory-safe. }
+{$V-}
